nftban-metrics (1.3.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * NFTBan v1.3.0 release - Monitoring & Export
  * Add native Zabbix integration with multi-target support
  * Add Low-Level Discovery (LLD) for dynamic entities
  * Add generic connectors: Elasticsearch, Kafka, NDJSON file
  * Add Zabbix templates for 5.x (XML) and 6.x+ (YAML)
  * Add 85+ metrics with comprehensive coverage
  * Add TLS/PSK encryption support for Zabbix

 -- NFTBan Development Team <noreply@nftban.org>  Wed, 22 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0000

